  "label": "Visual Metaphor: Camels Shouting as a Symbol of Absurdity",
  "description": "The image of three camels with their mouths open is a visual pun used to represent the 'logic' being mocked. The camels are not literally shouting, but their posture and expression are used to symbolize the absurdity or ridiculousness of the claim. This visual metaphor is a common trope in internet memes to convey a sense of 'laughing' or 'shouting' at a foolish idea. The meme relies on this visual metaphor to enhance the comedic and provocative effect of the text.",
